@page "/databinding"
@attribute [InteractiveServer]

<h1>Data binding (@@bind + Input*)</h1>

<p>Exercises <code>@@bind</code> / <code>InputText</code> with <code>ValueExpression</code> /
<code>FieldIdentifier</code>. The binding expression is walked against the descriptors generated for
<code>Person</code>, so no delegate is compiled.</p>

<EditForm Model="Model">
    <label>Name: <InputText id="name" @bind-Value="Model.Name" /></label>
</EditForm>

<p>Bound value: <span id="bound">@Model.Name</span></p>

@code {
    // Named by a [BindableModel] on the host's metadata context, so "() => Model.Name" resolves its
    // FieldIdentifier by walking descriptors instead of compiling the expression.
    public Person Model { get; } = new();

    public sealed class Person
    {
        public string Name { get; set; } = "";
    }
}
